        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "But is this notice really that bad? It is not untrue, and despite its misdirection, it is not trying to dupe customers into doing anything against their interests. We might wish that utility company had been more straightforward about its decision to raise its rates, but either way, we’re still required to pay them.",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                117,
                771,
                218
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 1,
            "group_id": 2,
            "global_block_id": 2,
            "global_group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    78.0,
                    117.0
                ],
                [
                    771.0,
                    117.0
                ],
                [
                    771.0,
                    218.0
                ],
                [
                    78.0,
                    218.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "This example suggests another standard, what we'll call the \"silver rule\" of an ethical style:",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                221,
                772,
                271
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 3,
            "global_block_id": 3,
            "global_group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    78.0,
                    221.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    221.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    271.0
                ],
                [
                    78.0,
                    271.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Do not write to others as you would not have others write to you.",
            "block_bbox": [
                115,
                284,
                666,
                308
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 4,
            "global_block_id": 4,
            "global_group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    115.0,
                    284.0
                ],
                [
                    666.0,
                    284.0
                ],
                [
                    666.0,
                    308.0
                ],
                [
                    115.0,
                    308.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The golden rule of style is a principle of empathy: it challenges writers to hold their readers' interests at least equal to their own and to write with their readers' interests in mind; the silver rule is a principle of fairness: it allows writers to pursue their own interests even at a cost to their readers, so long as they do not willfully deceive or cause gratuitous harm. That notice violates our golden rule, but it meets the lesser standard of the silver rule.",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                323,
                772,
                475
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 5,
            "global_block_id": 5,
            "global_group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    78.0,
                    323.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    323.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    475.0
                ],
                [
                    78.0,
                    475.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The golden rule of style expresses an ideal to which writers should aspire; the silver rule of style defines what all readers should at least be able to expect. It is still a high standard, and when writers violate it, they abrade the trust that sustains a civil society.",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                478,
                772,
                581
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 6,
            "global_block_id": 6,
            "global_group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    78.0,
                    478.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    478.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    581.0
                ],
                [
                    78.0,
                    581.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Who Dies? Finally, here are two passages that concern life and death. This label from the Consumer Product Safety Commission appears on bags of charcoal:",
